  "question": {
    "text": "If each term of a geometric progression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>…</mo></math> with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>≠</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>, is the arithmetic mean of the next two terms and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>…</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>20</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>18</mn></msub></math> is equal to",
